  "ai.orion81Builds": "I-Orion-81 yakhelwe phezu kwesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekileko etlolwe ngabantu. Itlolwe lapha ngombana ayenziwanga nge-AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>I-Orion-81 yiphrojekthi eyenziwe ngokuphelele nge-AI.<\/0> Umugqa ngamunye wekhodi ye-Orion-81 ngokwayo watlolwa nge-Claude Code, ilawulwa ngumsunguli. Umkhumbi ngamunye, imephu, ithekisitjhara nomsindo kwenziwe ziinsiza ezitlolwe yi-Claude Code. Umsunguli unquma ukuthi yini ekufanele yakhiwe; i-Claude Code ifumana ukuthi kwenziwa njani. Amalayibrari womthombo ovulekileko ewakhelwe phezu kwawo atlolwe ngaphasi 'Ayenziwanga nge-AI'. Kusele into enye ehlala ivulekile begodu itjengiswa ngokuphandle: <1>ukuhlolwa kwelayisense<\/1> yekhodi yomdlalo efike evela ephrothotayipini ye-GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "I-Orion yathoma mhlaka-28 kuSeptemba 2026 njengephrothotayipi ku-enjini yomthombo ovulekileko ye-Quake III Arena (GPL), imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous iyikuthaba kwayo. Ngelanga lesibili ikhodi yomdlalo yathuthela ku-BuB, injini entjha etlolwe nge-Claude Code; iimodyuli zomdlalo zafika ezivela ephrothotayipini zaphinda zathiywa kabutjha. Ukukhululwa kwe-0.3.0 kwanikela zoke iigaba ezili-16 zemikhumbi imizimba emitjha eyazo ngokwazo. Ukuhlolwa kokulandela ilayisense kuhlola ukuthi ikhona yini ikhodi esalingiswe emthonjeni we-GPL, nokuthi iimiklamo yakuqala yemikhumbi isondele khulu na kokuyikuthaba kwayo. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelako kokufana kwekhodi nomthombo wephrothotayipi ye-GPL kwenziwa mhlaka-8 kuOktoba 2026, nokuhlolwa kweengcongcoshe kokufanako okutholakeleko kuyaqhubeka. Konke okuthathwe kwenye indawo kuzotlolwa kabutjha namtjhana kuklanywe kabutjha.",
