  "economy.todayHead": "Okukhona namhlanjesi",
  "economy.todayLead": "Iinqongo zomzimba nesiphephelo zesikrini se-LOADOUT nemibala yesiphephelo (0.6.0) zitjengisa uhlobo lokuthuthukiswa nezinto zokuhlobisa ezomnotho okuhlosele ukuzinikela.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Ngombana imali etholwako ihlosele ukubahlawula. Umdlalo uthoma wenziwe ngokuphelele nge-AI ukuze ube khona, bese abahlophisi abahlawulwako bathatha isikhundla somsebenzi we-AI, batlolwe ngamagama.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ngingadlala ku-inthanethi na?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Kudlalwa mahala na?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Imibuzo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Hayi okwamanje. Umdlalo wabadlali abanengi we-LAN kunethiwekhi efanako uyasebenza namhlanjesi (kusukela ku-0.2.0); ukudlala ku-inthanethi akukakhiwi.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Iphrothotayipi yakhiwa ku-enjini yomthombo ovulekileko ye-Quake III Arena (GPL) yathatha imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous njengokuthaba. Ngelanga lesibili ikhodi yomdlalo yathuthela ku-BuB, injini entjha etlolwe nge-Claude Code; iimodyuli zomdlalo zafika ezivela ephrothotayipini zaphinda zathiywa kabutjha. Ukukhululwa kwe-0.3.0 kwanikela zoke iigaba ezili-16 zemikhumbi imizimba emitjha. Ukuhlolwa kokulandela ilayisense kuhlola ukuthi ikhona yini ikhodi esalingiswe emthonjeni we-GPL nokuthi iimiklamo yakuqala yemikhumbi isondele khulu na kokuyikuthaba kwayo. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelako kokufana kwekhodi nomthombo wephrothotayipi ye-GPL kwenziwa mhlaka <0/>, nokuhlolwa kweengcongcoshe kokufanako okutholakeleko kuyaqhubeka. Konke okuthathwe kwenye indawo kuzotlolwa kabutjha namtjhana kuklanywe kabutjha. Kuze kuphele ukuhlolwa, asiqinisekisi ukuthi impendulo ithi hayi.",
  "faq.questions": "Imibuzo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Imikhumbi, imidwebo, isikhombimsebenzisi nokunye, ngokuya ngemali etholakalako. <0>Ibhuku elikhasini leli<\/0> libala into ngayinye begodu lizotjengisa ukuthatha isikhundla ngakunye nomdwebi wakho.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Imikhumbi nokuthuthukiswa kuhlelelwe ukuzuzwa ngokudlala namtjhana ukuthengwa. Indlela imikhumbi ehlawulelwako ihlala ibulungile ngayo emdlalweni wabadlali ngokumelana nabadlali isalokhu iklanywa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Yilo ihlelo: kudlalwa mahala kunemali yomdlalo nezinto zokuhlobisa ezikhethwako. Akukakhiwi.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ingabe umsebenzi womuntu ukopishiwe na?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Ikhuphuka nini, begodu kuyini?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ngiziphi iingcenye abantu abazozithatha isikhundla, begodu ngizakwazi njani?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kungani umdlalo owenziwe nge-AI ungasiza abahlophisi?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Ngabe kuzaba kuthengwa ukuwina na?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "I-Windows PC. Akukho suku lokukhululwa namtjhana inani okwamanje.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "I-Anthropic, i-Claude ne-Claude Code zimaki zika-Anthropic, PBC. I-Unreal Engine ne-Epic Games zimaki ze-Epic Games, Inc. I-Blender yimaki ye-Blender Foundation. I-Quake III Arena ne-Elite Dangerous zimaki zabanikazi bazo. Wonke amagama ayabanikazi bawo begodu asetjenziselwa kuphela ukuhlonza iimikhiqizo ezikhulunywa ngazo. I-Orion-81 ayihlobene nabo, ayixhaswa begodu ayivunywanga yinoma ngubani kubo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Okuhlosiweko. Akukho ubambiswano, ubuhlobo namtjhana ukuvunywa okukhona.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Isiteshi siyeza",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Idevlogi ku-YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landela i-Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Abambisani bangokuzayo?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Akukho iinsiza zokulandela. Akukho amakuki. Iwebhusayithi lokubuka kuthomba. Iqiniso ngalinye lilandelwa ku-arkhivu yephrojekthi; akukho lapha okuyisiphakelo namtjhana isithembiso.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ayikavulwa",
