  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>I-Orion-81 yiphrojekthi eyenziwe ngokuphelele nge-AI.<\/0> Ikhodi ye-Orion-81 ngokwayo yenziwe nge-Claude Code, ilawulwa ngumsunguli; imikhumbi, iimephu, amathekisitjhara nemisindo kukhiqizwe ziinsiza ezitlolwe yi-Claude Code. Amalayibrari womthombo ovulekileko ewasebenzisako atlolwe ngaphasi <1>'Ayenziwanga nge-AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Ifuthara yewebhusayithi",
